          Monitor employee discussions on technical forums about hardware infrastructure
          Parse SNMP responses to gather hardware details from networked devices
          Review technical documentation and manuals on victim's support portals
          Analyze network traffic for hardware identifiers and device fingerprints
          Scrape employee resumes for mentions of specific hardware platforms
          Monitor security assessment reports leaked or published online
