          Create time-of-check-time-of-use (TOCTOU) exploit primitives
          Develop exploits targeting embedded device debugging interfaces
          Create hardware debugging tools for SoC vulnerability analysis
          Implement exploits targeting trusted execution environments (TEE)
          Develop PLC exploitation frameworks targeting industrial protocols
          Create exploits targeting AI model vulnerabilities through input manipulation
          Develop Bluetooth protocol stack exploit chains
          Create RF-based exploits targeting software-defined radio systems
          Implement smart card and NFC protocol exploitation techniques
          Develop exploits targeting UEFI/BIOS firmware interfaces
          Create exploits for quantum computing system vulnerabilities
          Implement USB protocol fuzzing and exploitation frameworks
