          Configure custom password hash sync rules in cloud directory
          Exploit cloud SSO session cookies for persistent access
          Create shadow admin accounts through indirect role assignments
          Manipulate cloud identity protection policies to bypass alerts
          Configure persistent access through cloud-based password resets
          Exploit cloud service principal certificate-based authentication
          Exploit AWS Lambda execution role credentials
          Abuse Kubernetes service account tokens for persistence
          Configure persistent access through cloud database IAM authentication
          Exploit cloud storage service endpoint authentication
