          Modify multiple user-specific UUID plist files to ensure persistence across different user accounts
          Create symbolic links in the application paths to redirect execution
          Use Launch Services API to register malicious app as default handler for common file types
          Implement watchdog process to monitor and restore plist modifications if removed
          Use NSUserDefaults API to modify login window preferences programmatically
