          Use CMSTP.exe to load remote COM scriptlets (SCT files) through INF files
          Leverage CMSTP.exe with specially crafted INF to load malicious DLLs from network shares
          Execute CMSTP.exe with /au flag to bypass UAC through auto-elevation
          Use CMSTP.exe to install malicious service profiles that persist across reboots
