          Use InstallUtil to load assemblies from memory using custom installer class with Assembly.Load()
          Chain InstallUtil with Microsoft.Workflow.Compiler for nested proxy execution
          Execute InstallUtil using rundll32 advpack.dll,LaunchINFSection to add additional proxy layers
