          Execute mavinject.exe with environment variables to obscure paths: mavinject.exe <PID> /INJECTRUNNING %TEMP%\payload.dll
          Chain mavinject.exe with process creation monitoring evasion techniques
          Use mavinject.exe to inject into newly created processes before security products initialize
