          Exploit SSH ProxyCommand for command execution
          Use SSH with certificates for authentication bypass
          Enable SSH root login by modifying sshd_config
          Create reverse SSH tunnels for remote access (e.g., ssh -R remote_port:localhost:local_port)
          Use ssh-keyscan to harvest SSH host keys from network ranges
          Exploit SSH keyboard-interactive authentication
          Deploy custom SSH honeypots to capture credentials
          Use SSH with SOCKS proxy for network pivoting
          Leverage SSH jump hosts for indirect access
          Modify SSH known_hosts file to bypass host verification
          Use SSH multiplexing for persistent connections
          Deploy custom SSH wrapper scripts for logging credentials
          Exploit SSH X11 forwarding for GUI access
          Use SSH file transfer capabilities (SCP/SFTP) for malware deployment
          Use Ansible/Puppet SSH automation for mass lateral movement
