          Leverage Empire's ticket-related modules for extraction and reuse
          Use Impacket's GetTGT.py to request tickets on Linux systems
          Create service tickets for MSSQL using ticketer.py with specific SPNs
          Use KeytabExtract for Unix/Linux Kerberos ticket extraction
          Generate tickets for Azure AD services using AADInternals
          Use Covenant C2's ticket manipulation commands
          Extract tickets using Sessionmanager for Windows Server
          Use gettgtpkinit for PKI-based ticket generation
          Employ KrbRelay for ticket relay attacks
          Use Heimdal Kerberos toolkit for cross-platform ticket manipulation
          Create Exchange service tickets using PowerView's Get-ExchangeToken
          Employ SharpKatz for .NET-based ticket operations
          Use KrbCredExport/KrbCredImport for ticket backup and restoration
