          Leverage KrbRelayUp for SYSTEM privilege escalation via tickets
          Use Rubeus's tgtdeleg for delegation token extraction
          Modify ticket timestamps using krbtgt key and Mimikatz
          Create ResourceBasedConstrainedDelegation tickets using PowerMad
          Use KrbMethodsUtils for Java-based ticket manipulation
          Generate tickets in containerized environments using GKE workload identity
          Create S4U2Proxy tickets for constrained delegation
          Use ROADtools for Azure AD hybrid ticket manipulation
          Exploit WebClient service for ticket relay using PetitPotam
          Create forged RBCD tickets using ntlmrelayx
          Use ADCSPwn for certificate-based ticket generation via ADCS
          Use KeyBricks for HSM-protected ticket extraction
