          Use readpst utility in Linux to convert PST files to readable formats
          Access Thunderbird email storage in profile directories under %APPDATA%\Thunderbird\Profiles
          Use Nirsoft's OutlookAttachView to extract email attachments from OST/PST files
          Parse Windows Mail app data from %LocalAppData%\Packages\microsoft.windowscommunicationsapps*\LocalState
          Employ forensic tools like FTK Imager to extract email artifacts
          Use eseutil.exe to repair and compact corrupted OST/PST files for access
          Extract cached Exchange emails from Windows Registry using reg.exe
          Access Windows Live Mail storage files (.eml) in %LocalAppData%\Microsoft\Windows Live Mail
          Extract Mozilla SeaMonkey email data from %APPDATA%\Mozilla\SeaMonkey\Profiles
          Use Python scripts with win32com.client to programmatically access Outlook objects
