          Deploy SNMPb browser with custom MIB files for vendor-specific information gathering
          Use SNMP Informant's extended MIB modules for detailed Windows system information
          Implement SNMP multiplexing with AgentX protocol for distributed collection
          Use OpenNMS SNMP collection configurations for targeted data gathering
