          Deploy Digi Connect IT console server for remote terminal access
          Install Opengear console server with cellular out-of-band management
          Install NetScout hardware tap with remote access capabilities
          Deploy Cubro network TAP device with remote management
          Use custom-modified USB hub with embedded remote access capability
          Implement BeagleBone Black with custom remote access firmware
          Install Tibbo programmable hardware for covert remote access
          Deploy Lantronix EDS hardware terminal server with SSH access
          Use modified network card with backdoored firmware for remote access
          Install Arduino-based custom remote access hardware disguised as peripheral
