          Structure C2 to mimic popular CDN providers' edge computing function calls
          Implement C2 traffic that resembles ServiceNow REST API interactions
          Structure C2 traffic to mimic blockchain node communication patterns including block synchronization
          Configure C2 to appear as Stripe API payment processing calls with proper webhooks
          Implement C2 traffic that resembles AWS Lambda function invocations and responses
