          Utilize web shell uploads through file upload vulnerabilities to gain persistent access and modify website content
          Compromise FTP/SFTP credentials through brute force attacks to directly modify website files
          Execute cross-site scripting (XSS) attacks to inject malicious JavaScript that dynamically modifies page content
