          Create fake app update prompts that mimic Google Play Store interface
          Deploy contextual overlays that activate based on specific user actions or times
          Use accessibility services to auto-fill malicious forms with suggested credentials
          Create fake biometric authentication prompts to capture fallback passwords
          Implement multi-stage overlay attacks that progressively request more sensitive data
          Use screen recording permission prompts to mask credential harvesting
          Deploy fake security warning overlays that prompt for "verification" of credentials
          Create overlays that mimic carrier/mobile operator authentication portals
          Create fake Mobile Device Management (MDM) configuration prompts to harvest enterprise credentials
          Implement manufacturer-specific UI overlays (Samsung Knox, MIUI, etc.)
          Use split-screen attacks to create convincing credential harvesting scenarios
          Deploy fake OS-level encryption key backup prompts
          Create overlays mimicking corporate VPN authentication dialogs
          Implement fake certificate installation prompts for man-in-the-middle attack setup
          Use screen pinning mode to prevent escape from credential harvesting overlays
