          Deploy overlays that mimic secure keyboard input methods
          Implement fake developer options prompts to harvest debug-level permissions
          Create overlays mimicking popular mobile payment service authentications (Google Pay, Samsung Pay)
          Implement fake cloud storage access prompts (Dropbox, Google Drive) during document access
          Deploy overlays during device backup/restore processes to appear more legitimate
          Create fake emergency call/SOS prompt overlays to capture unlock patterns
          Implement overlays that activate during device setup/configuration changes
          Use overlays mimicking app store payment verification flows
