          Harvest datasets from victim organization's public GitHub repositories using GitHub API
          Access and download open datasets from cloud storage services (AWS S3, Google Cloud Storage) using cloud CLI tools
          Scrape academic research repositories (e.g., PapersWithCode, UCI ML Repository) for relevant datasets
