        Insert Backdoor Trigger: The adversary may add a perceptual trigger into inference data. The trigger may be imperceptible or non-obvious to humans. This technique is used in conjunction with [Poison AI Model](/techniques/AML.T0018.000) and allows the adversary to produce their desired effect in the target model.
